#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An introduction to quantum machine learning (QML), data encoding, kernel "
"methods and variational quantum circuits."
msgstr ""
"Pengenalan kepada pembelajaran mesin kuantum (QML), pengekodan data, kaedah "
"kernel dan Circuit kuantum variasi."

